{"v":4,"catch":"女戰士亞馬遜！逮捕所有越獄者！ ！","desc":"“Soldier Girl Amazon”是Nichibutsu於1986年發行的射擊遊戲。\n那個女戰士亞馬遜在完全改變的地球上戰鬥。 地球被奇怪的野獸和瘋狂的機器人所控制。\n從敵人那裡帶走空中美孚，追逐從宇宙中的恆星逃脫的囚犯。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2022-06-23","genres":["射擊","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/58eb3e3821aef4f9ad5e179fb01e2b82a5b6acadf3695a248d831f18881352aa.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/536c5246a6de8bed3fd4adab324400ab36f14f97a1d650ea7737a23abc2ffa50.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/038c30ced2ef1f458b6d1250490883a252f4111d4e9187ee973d4ee4e2fdc2d1.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a04870ffa1225fbb7339840418c053e267c672f610affa57492c80f8f97d6df9.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/2e5feb4b22fad5ed9c15b2a03044dbf42ff4f633cf9926d5f6c5f88b70aa36d4.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/32e210d535821950b9de6d4aeb7cf173adbabe7d7477b5e4c873c236e488dfeb.jpg"],"titleId":"01001bc009806000","dlc":[]}